        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Laurey 794, 3 Inch Traditional Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Middlewich Cabinet Pull is the perfect addition for classic homes. whether you use it in the kitchen on cabinets or as a furniture pull, this Traditional Cabinet Pull is at once beautiful and familiar. This Classic Traditions Pull comes from the Laurey Georgetown Collection. It will fit cabinets with 3 inch mounting holes and comes packaged with the hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Georgetown\">Laurey Georgetown Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 3 Inch Middlewich Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
